notes:
  - No CMS or API layer. All content is committed in src/data/*.ts.
  - work.ts is the canonical source of truth; index page reads grouped arrays, project page resolves by slug from `allEntries`.
  - Per project memory: prefer allEntries.find() over destructuring complex fields from Astro.props on the dynamic route.
  - image-alt is flagged for a P2 upgrade: replace derived function with hand-written lookup map.
